  "config.kurumamod.show_dust.tooltip": "Throw up the dust the wheels tear off dirt, sand, gravel and snow. It hangs where it was thrown, so the car leaves a trail behind it. Nothing is thrown on tarmac or ice (there is nothing loose to throw), and rain stops it - though under a tunnel or bridge the dust keeps flying.",
  "config.kurumamod.dust_density": "Dust density",
  "config.kurumamod.dust_density.tooltip": "Multiplier for how much dust is thrown. 1.0 is the default; it scales the particle count directly, so turn it down if it costs you frames. To switch it off entirely, use the toggle above.",
